@startuml context-map
title Context Map — Sistema de Itinerarios Personales

package "Airport Context" <<Bounded Context>> {
  [Airport] as AirportAggregate
}

package "Itinerary Context" <<Bounded Context>> {
  [Itinerary] as ItineraryAggregate
}

package "Notification Context" <<Bounded Context>> {
  [Notification] as NotificationAggregate
}

cloud "API Colombia" <<Sistema externo>> as ApiColombia

ItineraryAggregate ..> AirportAggregate : Customer/Supplier\n(HTTP síncrono, Itinerary es cliente)
AirportAggregate ..> ApiColombia : Anticorruption Layer\n(ColombiaAirportAdapter)
ItineraryAggregate ..> NotificationAggregate : Published Language\n(ItineraryCreatedEvent, async - Nivel 2)

note bottom of AirportAggregate
  Airport Context es "upstream" respecto
  a Itinerary Context: Itinerary depende
  de la disponibilidad de Airport Service,
  pero no al revés.
end note

@enduml
